      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shalluum, Boqorkii Israa'iil",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Shalluum ina Yaabeesh wuxuu boqor noqday Cusiyaah oo ahaa boqorkii dalka Yahuudah sannaddiisii sagaal iyo soddonaad, oo muddo bil ah ayuu Samaariya boqor ku ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Menaxeem ina Gaadii ayaa ka kacay Tirsaah, oo wuxuu tegey Samaariya, markaasuu Shalluum ina Yaabeesh ku dilay Samaariya oo meeshiisii boqor ka noqday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Shalluum falimihiisii kale iyo sirqoolkii uu sameeyeyba waxay ku qoran yihiin kitaabkii taariikhda boqorradii dalka Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Menaxeem wuu wada laayay Tifsax iyo wixii ku jiray oo dhan, iyo soohdimaheedii marka Tirsaah laga bilaabo, maxaa yeelay, way ka furi waayeen, sidaas daraaddeed buuna u laayay; oo naagihii uurka lahaa oo magaalada ku jiray oo dhan wuu wada dooxay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
